  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\" You look down and see a bee in a suit. \"Do you talk? Did you just talk to me?\" I asked. \"Yes, Your Majesty. I come from that hive over there in a tree and we bees think you should be our queen\" \"I'm not a bee, I'm a human. And I'm allergic to bees!\" \"Yes, we know, but we think you're perfect for the job.\" said the little bee.\" \"Well I do like your little suit. Maybe I will consider. What do I have to do to be your queen?\", I asked. \"You just have to do one thing. You have to make a wish and we will grant it.\" I thought that sure sounded easy.",
